ll capacity does not increase the maximum flow.\na1→b1 gained as much as it was raised. Raise it further and another cut will get in the way sooner or later.\na2→b2 is on the cut, but another minimum cut without this edge remains, so nothing is gained."}},"artifacts":[{"card":"cut","output":"da96e2c5-e70a-4f21-b54c-1bdee65cf3b0","name":"da96e2c5-e70a-4f21-b54c-1bdee65cf3b0","members":[{"path":"cut.png","size":61033}]},{"card":"flow","output":"c2ee96e2-d8ac-4ca9-898e-ab73d6551795","name":"c2ee96e2-d8ac-4ca9-898e-ab73d6551795","members":[{"path":"flow.png","size":64598}]},{"card":"sweep","output":"92c10ba2-7e65-4a2c-8e0e-e0f5e908a596","name":"92c10ba2-7e65-4a2c-8e0e-e0f5e908a596","members":[{"path":"result.json","size":1905},{"path":"sweep.png","size":38552}]},{"card":"verify","output":"a61ad1f6-d164-4120-a95b-494974e886b6","name":"a61ad1f6-d164-4120-a95b-494974e886b6","members":[{"path":"result.json","size":187},{"path":"summary.md","size":382}]},{"card":"whatif","output":"9e49d694-5ea0-47ee-99e7-bad95b1dbbf8","name":"9e49d694-5ea0-47ee-99e7-bad95b1dbbf8","members":[{"path":"result.json","size":932},{"path":"summary.md","size":812}]}]}